{
  "text": "This phase carried the active filter set inside the cursor instead of leaving it to the query string. encodeCursor now writes a versioned payload (`v: 2`) containing the sort key, the offset and the filter map, and decodeCursor reads that payload back, defaulting a missing filter map to the empty set. The edit is confined to src/api/cursor.ts. No tests were run in this phase, so the fix is unverified as it stands.",
